      "body": "NATIVE JTML DEMO APP\n\nA single Friendly JTML file showing production app structure, live state, runtime APIs, media, graphics, routing, stores, effects, and host integrations.\n\nRelease undefined\n\nOverview\nCommand\nData\nMedia\nRuntime\nLogin\n\nCommand center\n\nLive operations workspace\n\nExecutive command center loaded.\n\nNotify host\nRefresh data\nSign out\n\nOpen incidents\n\n3\n\nPayment queue latency\n\nRisk\n\nControlled risk\n\n18% current score\n\nApprovals\n\n2\n\nApprovals in Lisbon\n\nIncident controls\n\nHandlers mutate state, effects update the audit trail, and the UI re-renders from reactive values.\n\nAcknowledge\nEscalate\nRisk -3\nRisk +5\n\nAudit: Ready for review.\n\nStore controls\n\nThe workspace store is globally addressable and keeps shared application state.\n\nRegion: Lisbon\n\nTier: Enterprise\n\nSwitch region\nApprove\nReset approvals\nWorkflow form\nHigh\nMedium\nLow\nSubmit workflow\nCapture note\nReset local form\n\nPriority: High\n\nPolicy accepted: false\n\nComponent isolation\n\nEach counter owns its own state even though both are created from the same component.\n\nDeploy approvals\n\n{{(\"Isolated count: \" + __LocalCounter_9_count)}}\n\n-1\n+1\nRollback readiness\n\n{{(\"Isolated count: \" + __LocalCounter_10_count)}}\n\n-1\n+1\n",
